# Character offsets in data/processed/*.csv index data/interim/cases_clean.csv's
# case_text. A checkout that rewrites LF as CRLF shifts every offset after a
# newline, which silently invalidates entity, measurement and relation spans
# (and made corpus.patients.validate_annotations fail). Normalize on commit and
# check out LF on every platform so the offsets stay valid.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touched by the rules above.
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.db binary
